      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CROCODILE CRAWL (1) settled off speed and overcame a collision with another runner to work home into the placings when third (22.41) at this track in a Grade 6. Has the ability and looks a key chance. MANX MAGIC (4) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (23.02) last time in a Grade 5/6 at Mandurah. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. CRENSHAW KING (7) was prominent early off a low draw but weakened and dropped out when 5th over 400m at Mandurah in Grade 5/6 company. Has a good record here at this journey. Likely to be about the money. LIKE A FERRARI (5) is a last-start placegetter at big odds who will have admirers.",
